---
// How to get the password for Andy's slide decks. The password is not
// published: people ask for it at an AI workshop or on Discord.
---

<div
    class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-4"
    data-slides-access
>
    <p>
        The slides are password protected. Ask for the password at one of our AI
        workshops or on our{" "}
        <a
            href="https://discord.gg/hmVycPYAue"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            Discord
            <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
        </a>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
        The code for each deck is public on GitHub. The slides from workshop 1
        are readable there too; later decks load their content only once the
        password is entered.
    </p>
</div>
